;Steadyline Scalper EA - default parameter set with optimization ranges
;Format: Value||Start||Step||Stop||Optimize(Y/N)
;Load via: MetaEditor/Strategy Tester > Expert properties > Inputs > Load
;Flip N to Y on a line to include that parameter in Optimization runs.
;
;Recommended workflow: pick ONE InpStrategyMode, leave InpStrategyMode
;itself at N (fixed), and only flip Y on that strategy's own parameters
;(group 0, 1, or 2 below) plus the shared ones (session/ATR/cooldown/risk)
;when optimizing -- sweeping across strategies in one pass wastes runs on
;parameters that don't apply to whichever mode a given run isn't using.
InpMagicNumber=20260825||20260825||1||20260825||N
InpSlippagePoints=10||10||1||10||N
InpStrategyMode=0||0||1||2||N
InpTimeframe=1||1||1||1||N
InpReverseSignal=0||0||1||1||N
;--- Strategy 0: EMA crossover + RSI filter
InpFastEmaPeriod=5||3||1||10||N
InpSlowEmaPeriod=13||10||1||25||N
InpRsiPeriod=14||10||2||20||N
InpRsiBuyMax=70.0||60.0||5.0||80.0||N
InpRsiSellMin=30.0||20.0||5.0||40.0||N
;--- Strategy 1: Bollinger Band mean-reversion
InpBbPeriod=20||10||2||30||N
InpBbDeviation=2.0||1.0||0.25||3.0||N
InpBbRsiOversold=30.0||20.0||5.0||40.0||N
InpBbRsiOverbought=70.0||60.0||5.0||80.0||N
;--- Strategy 2: Higher-TF trend + Stochastic pullback
InpTrendTimeframe=16385||16385||1||16385||N
InpTrendEmaPeriod=50||20||10||100||N
InpStochKPeriod=5||3||1||10||N
InpStochDPeriod=3||2||1||5||N
InpStochSlowing=3||1||1||5||N
InpStochOversold=20.0||10.0||5.0||30.0||N
InpStochOverbought=80.0||70.0||5.0||90.0||N
;--- Shared: session filter, ATR sizing, cost guards, risk
InpUseSessionFilter=1||1||1||1||N
InpSessionStartHour=7||0||1||23||N
InpSessionEndHour=19||0||1||23||N
InpAtrPeriod=14||10||2||20||N
InpSlAtrMultiplier=1.0||0.5||0.25||2.0||N
InpTpAtrMultiplier=1.5||0.75||0.25||3.0||N
InpMaxBarsInTrade=20||10||5||40||N
InpMaxSpreadPoints=20||10||5||30||N
InpCooldownBars=5||0||5||20||N
InpRiskPercent=0.5||0.25||0.25||1.0||N
InpMaxDailyLossPercent=3.0||3.0||1.0||3.0||N
